53.      * @param startDirectory the directory to start discovery from
54.      * @return a map of Path to Document for all discovered POM files
55.      * @throws IOException if there's an error reading files
56.      * @throws DomTripException if there's an error parsing XML
57.      */
58.     public static Map<Path, Document> discoverPoms(Path startDirectory) throws IOException, DomTripException {
59.         Map<Path, Document> pomMap = new HashMap<>();
60. 
61.         // Find and load the root POM
62.         Path rootPomPath = startDirectory.resolve(POM_XML);
63.         if (!Files.exists(rootPomPath)) {
