  *
  * <p>This class provides convenience methods that delegate to:
  * <ul>
  * <li>{@link eu.maveniverse.domtrip.maven.PomEditor} - DomTrip's PomEditor</li>
  * <li>{@link eu.maveniverse.domtrip.Element} - DomTrip's Element API</li>
  * </ul>
